{"id":212,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"志教育と探究で自ら学ぶ山脇学園","feature_description":"山脇学園は「志」教育を軸に、自ら課題を見つけ、深く学ぶ姿勢を育てます。6年間の学びにフォローアップ、グローバル教育、サイエンス教育を組み合わせ、基礎から発展へ段階的に学べる環境を整えています。生徒は学習やクラブ活動を通して興味を広げ、目標の実現に向けて取り組みます。自分の関心を広げる機会もあります。中学生もカフェテリアを利用できます。","clubs":[{"id":4694,"name":"写真同好会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4695,"name":"弦楽同好会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12851,"name":"EI（イングリッシュアイランド）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12852,"name":"SI（サイエンスアイランド）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12853,"name":"LI（リベラルアーツアイランド）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12854,"name":"書道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12855,"name":"華道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12856,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12857,"name":"手芸","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12858,"name":"漫研アルカディア","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12859,"name":"折り紙と砂絵","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12860,"name":"JRC","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12861,"name":"かるた","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yamawaki.ed.jp/schoo